  "config.really_radical_rolls.expression.vars.detail": "- $pitch：当前俯仰角（度）\n- $yaw：当前偏航角（度）\n- $roll：当前翻滚角（度）\n- $velocity_length：当前速度（格/刻）\n- $velocity_x/$velocity_y/$velocity_z：速度向量分量\n- $look_x/$look_y/$look_z：视线向量分量\n- $banking_strength：配置中的倾斜强度",
