  "config.really_radical_rolls.expression.fns.text": "sin(x) cos(x) tan(x) asin(x) acos(x) atan(x) sqrt(x) abs(x) ceil(x) floor(x) log(x) round(x) exp(x) min(x,y) max(x,y) randint(x[,y])",
  "config.really_radical_rolls.expression.fns.detail": "- sin/cos/tan：三角函数\n- asin/acos/atan：反三角函数\n- sqrt(x)：平方根\n- abs(x)：绝对值\n- ceil(x)/floor(x)/round(x)：不同取整方式\n- log(x)：自然对数\n- exp(x)：指数函数（e^x）\n- min(x,y)/max(x,y)：取较小/较大值\n- randint(max) 或 randint(min,max)：随机整数范围",
